// Title: Potential Persistence Via Visual Studio Tools for Office
// Rule ID: 9d15044a-7cfe-4d23-8085-6ebc11df7685
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.t1137.006, attack.persistence
// Category: registry_set
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
